Package: pertsig
Type: Package
Title: Perturbation Signatures Collection
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R:
    person("Aigul", "", email = "aigul@wustl.edu", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Loads pre-computed perturbation signatures (gene-level weights
    from logistic regression models) and turns them into gene sets of their
    top-weighted genes, ready for enrichment analysis with 'fgsea'.
License: MIT + file LICENSE
Encoding: UTF-8
Depends:
    R (>= 4.0.0)
Imports:
    data.table,
    tools,
    utils
Suggests:
    fgsea,
    GEOquery,
    ggplot2,
    ggrepel,
    knitr,
    limma,
    rmarkdown
VignetteBuilder: knitr
Roxygen: list(markdown = TRUE)
URL: https://github.com/alserglab/pertsig
BugReports: https://github.com/alserglab/pertsig/issues
Config/roxygen2/version: 8.1.1
